al.\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"mt-5\" data-kid=\"1-6-2-3-2\">\n                    Filtra por género, año, director o actor. Tu criterio queda registrado, fechado y comparable con el resto.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"cc-rev mt-14 grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 border-t-2 border-white pt-8 lg:grid-cols-[auto_1fr_1.2fr] lg:gap-14\" data-kid=\"1-6-3\">\n            <p class=\"f-serif text-[16vw] font-black leading-[0.8] text-[#E63946] lg:text-[9vw]\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-1\">\n                02\n            </p>\n            <h3 class=\"f-serif text-4xl font-bold uppercase leading-[0.95] lg:text-5xl\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-2\">\n                Organiza\n            </h3>\n            <div class=\"columns-1 gap-10 f-sans text-[13px] leading-[2] text-[#8D99AE] sm:columns-2\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-3\">\n                <p data-kid=\"1-6-3-3-1\">\n                    Guarda en Mi Lista lo que vas a ver, marca lo visto y arrastra los títulos a tu tier list personal S · A · B · C · D.\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"mt-5\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-3-2\">\n                    Estadísticas propias: géneros dominantes, décadas favoritas, media personal frente a la media global.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"cc-rev mt-14 grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 border-y-2 border-white py-8 lg:grid-cols-[auto_1fr_1.2fr] lg:gap-14\" data-kid=\"1-6-4\">\n            <p class=\"f-serif text-[16vw] font-black leading-[0.8] lg:text-[9vw]\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-1\">\n                03\n            </p>\n            <h3 class=\"f-serif text-4xl font-bold uppercase leading-[0.95] lg:text-5xl\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-2\">\n                Debate\n            </h3>\n            <div class=\"columns-1 gap-10 f-sans text-[13px] leading-[2] text-[#8D99AE] sm:columns-2\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3\">\n                <p data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-1\">\n                    Reseñas largas, hilos por título y respuestas con spoilers ocultos. Aquí se discute, no se aplaude.\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"mt-5\" data-kid=\"1-6-4-3-2\">\n                    Sigue a críticos con tu mismo gusto y descubre lo que aún no está en ninguna lista de recomendados.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <!-- ============ TIER LIST ============ -->\n    <section class=\"grid grid-cols-1 border-b-2 border-white lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr]\" data-kid=\"1-7\" id=\"ranking\">\n        <div class=\"border-white px-6 py-16 sm:px-10 lg:border-r-2 lg:px-14\" data-kid=\"1-7-1\">\n            <p class=\"f-sans text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.42em] text-[#E63946]\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1\">\n                Sección 04 — Tier list\n            </p>\n            <h2 class=\"cc-rev mt-6 f-serif text-[11vw] font-black uppercase leading-[0.85] tracking-[-0.03em] lg:text-[4.6vw]\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2\">\n                Ordena\n                <br data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-1\"/>\n                <span class=\"italic\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2-2\">\n                    tu canon.\n                </span>\n            </h2>\n            <p class=\"mt-8 max-w-[42ch] f-sans text-[11px] uppercase leading-[2.1] tracking-[0.2em] text-[#8D99AE]\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3\">\n                Arrastra, suelta, defiende. Cinco niveles, cero excusas.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"mt-12 border-2 border-white\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-4\">\n                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[86px_1fr] border-b-2 border-white\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-4-1\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center bg-[#ff79c6] py-6 f-serif text-3xl font-black text-black\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-4-1-1\">\n                        S\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 px-4 py-4\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-4-1-2\">\n                        <span class=\"border border-white px-3 py-1 f-sans text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em]\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-4-1-