percase tracking-[.34em] text-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"2-5-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"ranking pre-title\">\n                        Tablero del director\n                    </span>\n                    <h2 class=\"pf mt-4 text-[clamp(1.9rem,3.6vw,2.9rem)] font-bold leading-[1.12]\" data-kid=\"2-5-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"ranking headline\">\n                        Tu Tier List, clavada\n                        <br data-kid=\"2-5-1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"ranking headline break\"/>\n                        <span class=\"italic text-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"2-5-1-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"ranking headline highlight\">\n                            en el corcho.\n                        </span>\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-5 text-[15.5px] text-[var(--ink-2)]\" data-kid=\"2-5-1-1-1-3\" data-name=\"ranking explanation text\">\n                        Arrastra los títulos entre filas y decide, sin diplomacia, qué merece la S y qué se queda en la D. Comparte tu tablero y deja que la comunidad lo discuta.\n                    </p>\n                    <ul class=\"mt-7 space-y-3 text-[15px]\" data-kid=\"2-5-1-1-1-4\" data-name=\"features list\">\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\" data-kid=\"2-5-1-1-1-4-1\" data-name=\"list item 1\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-drag-drop mt-0.5 text-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"2-5-1-1-1-4-1-1\" data-name=\"drag drop icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            <span class=\"text-[var(--ink-2)]\" data-kid=\"2-5-1-1-1-4-1-2\" data-name=\"list text 1\">\n                                Arrastrar y soltar entre filas S · A · B · C · D\n                            </span>\n                        </li>\n                        <li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\" data-kid=\"2-5-1-1-1-4-2\" data-name=\"list item 2\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-share-2 mt-0.5 text-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"2-5-1-1-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"share icon\">\n   