-[var(--ink-3)]\" data-kid=\"2-7-1-2-3-4-2-2\" data-name=\"user meta 3\">\n                                Watchlist de 208\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </figcaption>\n                </figure>\n                <figure class=\"snap-i ticket w-[340px] shrink-0 bg-[linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(254,243,199,.08),rgba(254,243,199,.03))] p-7 ring-1 ring-[var(--line)]\" data-kid=\"2-7-1-2-4\" data-name=\"testimonial 4\">\n                    <div class=\"mb-4 flex gap-1 text-[15px] text-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"2-7-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"rating container 4\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-star-filled\" data-kid=\"2-7-1-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"star 1\">\n                        </i>\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-star-filled\" data-kid=\"2-7-1-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"star 2\">\n                        </i>\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-star-filled\" data-kid=\"2-7-1-2-4-1-3\" data-name=\"star 3\">\n                        </i>\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-star-filled\" data-kid=\"2-7-1-2-4-1-4\" data-name=\"star 4\">\n                        </i>\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-star\" data-kid=\"2-7-1-2-4-1-5\" data-name=\"star 5\">\n                        </i>\n                    </div>\n                    <blockquote class=\"pf text-[19px] italic leading-[1.55] text-[var(--cream)]\" data-kid=\"2-7-1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"quote 4\">\n                        “Las estadísticas de fin de año me delataron: 61 policiales. Ahora sé exactamente qué género me falta.”\n                    </blockquote>\n                    <div class=\"perf my-6 h-3 w-full opacity-50\" data-kid=\"2-7-1-2-4-3\" data-name=\"perforation line 4\">\n                    </div>\n                    <figcaption class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"2-7-1-2-4-4\" data-name=\"user info 4\">\n                        <img alt=\"Tomás L.\" class=\"h-11 w-11 rounded-full object-cover ring-1 ring-[var(--line)]\" data-kid=\"2-7-1-2-4-4-1\" data-name=\"user avatar 4\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/64?u=tomas\"/>\n                        <div data-kid=\"2-7-1-2-4-4-2\" data-name=\"user profile 4\">\n                            <div class=\"text-[14px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"2-7-1-2-4-4-2-1\" data-name=\"user name 4\">\n                                Tomás L.\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-[var(--ink-3)]\" data-kid=\"2-7-1-2-4-4-2-2\" data-name=\"user meta 4\">\n                                1.130 vistas\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </figcaption>\n                </figure>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <!-- ============ FAQ ============ -->\n    <section class=\"py-24\" data-kid=\"2-8\" data-name=\"faq section\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[900px] px-6\" data-kid=\"2-8-1\" data-name=\"faq container\">\n            <div class=\"reveal mb-12 text-center\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-1\" data-name=\"faq header container\">\n                <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.34em] text-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-1-1\" data-name=\"pre-title\">\n                    Antes de entrar en sala\n                </span>\n                <h2 class=\"pf mt-4 text-[clamp(1.9rem,3.6vw,2.9rem)] font-bold\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-1-2\" data-name=\"headline\">\n                    Preguntas frecuentes\n                </h2>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"reveal border-t border-[var(--line)]\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2\" data-name=\"questions list\">\n                <details class=\"group border-b border-[var(--line)] py-5\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-1\" data-name=\"q1 container\">\n                    <summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-6\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"q1 summary\">\n                        <span class=\"faq-q pf text-[19px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"q1 text\">\n                            ¿Es gratis?\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"faq-plus text-[20px] text-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"q1 plus icon container\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-plus\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"q1 icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 max-w-[720px] text-[15px] text-[var(--ink-2)]\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"q1 answer\">\n                        Sí. Crear tu cuenta, calificar, comentar y armar tu watchlist no cuesta nada y no pedimos tarjeta. Más adelante habrá extras opcionales para quienes quieran estadísticas avanzadas.\n                    </p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"group border-b border-[var(--line)] py-5\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-2\" data-name=\"q2 container\">\n                    <summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-6\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"q2 summary\">\n                        <span class=\"faq-q pf text-[19px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"q2 text\">\n                            ¿Puedo importar mi lista?\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"faq-plus text-[20px] text-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"q2 plus icon container\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-plus\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"q2 icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 max-w-[720px] text-[15px] text-[var(--ink-2)]\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"q2 answer\">\n                        Podés subir un CSV con títulos y notas, o pegar una lista de texto: CineClassify reconoce los títulos y las asocia con su ficha automáticamente.\n                    </p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"group border-b border-[var(--line)] py-5\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-3\" data-name=\"q3 container\">\n                    <summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-6\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"q3 summary\">\n                        <span class=\"faq-q pf text-[19px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"q3 text\">\n                            ¿Cómo funciona la Tier List?\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"faq-plus text-[20px] text-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"q3 plus icon container\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-plus\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"q3 icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 max-w-[720px] text-[15px] text-[var(--ink-2)]\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"q3 answer\">\n                        Arrastrás cada título entre las filas S, A, B, C y D. El tablero se guarda solo y podés compartirlo con un enlace público para que otros lo comenten o armen su versión.\n                    </p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"group border-b border-[var(--line)] py-5\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-4\" data-name=\"q4 container\">\n                    <summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-6\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"q4 summary\">\n                        <span class=\"faq-q pf text-[19px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"q4 text\">\n                            ¿Hay app móvil?\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"faq-plus text-[20px] text-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"q4 plus icon container\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-plus\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"q4 icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 max-w-[720px] text-[15px] text-[var(--ink-2)]\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"q4 answer\">\n                        La web está pensada para el móvil y se instala como aplicación desde el navegador. Las apps nativas para iOS y Android están en camino.\n                    </p>\n                </details>\n                <details class=\"group border-b border-[var(--line)] py-5\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-5\" data-name=\"q5 container\">\n                    <summary class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-6\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-5-1\" data-name=\"q5 summary\">\n                        <span class=\"faq-q pf text-[19px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"q5 text\">\n                            ¿Puedo comentar?\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"faq-plus text-[20px] text-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-5-1-2\" data-name=\"q5 plus icon container\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-plus\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-5-1-2-1\" data-name=\"q5 icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 max-w-[720px] text-[15px] text-[var(--ink-2)]\" data-kid=\"2-8-1-2-5-2\" data-name=\"q5 answer\">\n                        Claro. Cada ficha tiene reseñas con hilos de respuesta, avisos de spoilers y moderación de la comunidad para que el debate se mantenga civilizado.\n                    </p>\n                </details>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <!-- ============ FINAL CTA ============ -->\n    <section class=\"relative px-6 py-16\" data-kid=\"2-9\" data-name=\"final cta section\">\n        <div class=\"reveal grain relative mx-auto max-w-[1100px] overflow-hidden rounded-[26px] border border-[rgba(245,158,11,.32)] bg-[radial-gradient(90%_120%_at_50%_0%,rgba(245,158,11,.20),transparent_62%),linear-gradient(180deg,#1a1209,#0d0a08)] px-6 py-20 text-center shadow-[0_40px_90px_rgba(0,0,0,.55)]\" data-kid=\"2-9-1\" data-name=\"cta card container\">\n            <img alt=\"\" class=\"deco pointer-events-none absolute left-4 top-4 h-14 w-14 opacity-50\" data-kid=\"2-9-1-1\" data-name=\"corner decoration 1\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/game-icons-transparent@latest/svgs/lorc/corner-explosion.svg\"/>\n            <img alt=\"\" class=\"deco pointer-events-none absolute right-4 top-4 h-14 w-14 -scale-x-100 opacity-50\" data-kid=\"2-9-1-2\" data-name=\"corner decoration 2\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/game-icons-transparent@latest/svgs/lorc/corner-explosion.svg\"/>\n            <img alt=\"\" class=\"deco pointer-events-none absolute bottom-4 left-4 h-12 w-12 opacity-40\" data-kid=\"2-9-1-3\" data-name=\"corner decoration 3\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/game-icons-transparent@latest/svgs/delapouite/fleur-de-lys.svg\"/>\n            <img alt=\"\" class=\"deco pointer-events-none absolute bottom-4 right-4 h-12 w-12 opacity-40\" data-kid=\"2-9-1-4\" data-name=\"corner decoration 4\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/game-icons-transparent@latest/svgs/delapouite/fleur-de-lys.svg\"/>\n            <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.34em] text-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"2-9-1-5\" data-name=\"cta pre-title\">\n                Última función\n            </span>\n            <h2 class=\"pf glow-text mx-auto mt-5 max-w-[720px] text-[clamp(2.1rem,4.6vw,3.6rem)] font-bold leading-[1.08]\" data-kid=\"2-9-1-6\" data-name=\"cta headline\">\n                Únete a la crítica.\n                <br data-kid=\"2-9-1-6-1\" data-name=\"cta headline break\"/>\n                <span class=\"italic text-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"2-9-1-6-2\" data-name=\"cta headline highlight\">\n                    Regístrate hoy.\n                </span>\n            </h2>\n            <p class=\"mx-auto mt-5 max-w-[520px] text-[16px] text-[var(--ink-2)]\" data-kid=\"2-9-1-7\" data-name=\"cta description\">\n                Gratis, en un minuto y con tu primera calificación lista antes de que empiecen los créditos.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"2-9-1-8\" data-name=\"cta buttons container\">\n                <button class=\"gold-pill rounded-full bg-[var(--gold)] px-10 py-4 text-[15px] font-bold text-[#231404] shadow-[0_16px_44px_rgba(245,158,11,.34)]\" data-kid=\"2-9-1-8-1\" data-name=\"cta register button\">\n                    Crear cuenta gratis\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"ghost-pill rounded-full border border-[rgba(254,243,199,.28)] px-8 py-4 text-[15px] font-semibold text-[var(--cream)]\" data-kid=\"2-9-1-8-2\" data-name=\"cta login button\">\n                    Iniciar Sesión\n                </button>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"mt-6 text-[12px] uppercase tracking-[.2em] text-[var(--ink-3)]\" data-kid=\"2-9-1-9\" data-name=\"cta disclaimer\">\n                Sin tarjeta · Sin spam · Cancela cuando quieras\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <!-- ============ CONTACTO ============ -->\n    <section class=\"py-24\" data-kid=\"2-10\" data-name=\"contact section\" id=\"contacto\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1100px] gap-12 px-6 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:px-10\" data-kid=\"2-10-1\" data-name=\"contact inner container\">\n            <div class=\"reveal\" data-kid=\"2-10-1-1\" data-name=\"contact info block\">\n                <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[.34em] text-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"2-10-1-1-1\" data-name=\"contact pre-title\">\n                    Taquilla\n                </span>\n                <h2 class=\"pf mt-4 text-[clamp(1.8rem,3.4vw,2.6rem)] font-bold leading-[1.12]\" data-kid=\"2-10-1-1-2\" data-name=\"contact headline\">\n                    Contáctanos\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"mt-5 text-[15.5px] text-[var(--ink-2)]\" data-kid=\"2-10-1-1-3\" data-name=\"contact description\">\n                    ¿Falta un título en el catálogo? ¿Encontraste un error o querés proponer una función? Escribinos: respondemos en menos de 48 horas.\n                </p>\n                <ul class=\"mt-8 space-y-4 text-[14.5px]\" data-kid=\"2-10-1-1-4\" data-name=\"contact links list\">\n                    <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-[var(--ink-2)]\" data-kid=\"2-10-1-1-4-1\" data-name=\"contact email\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-mail text-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"2-10-1-1-4-1-1\" data-name=\"mail icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        hola@cineclassify.pro\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-[var(--ink-2)]\" data-kid=\"2-10-1-1-4-2\" data-name=\"contact twitter\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-brand-x text-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"2-10-1-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"twitter icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        @cineclassify\n                    </li>\n                    <li class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-[var(--ink-2)]\" data-kid=\"2-10-1-1-4-3\" data-name=\"contact hours\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-clock-hour-4 text-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"2-10-1-1-4-3-1\" data-name=\"clock icon\">\n                        </i>\n                        Lun a Vie · 10:00 – 19:00\n                    </li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n            <form class=\"reveal rounded-[20px] border border-[var(--line)] bg-[rgba(254,243,199,.045)] p-7 backdrop-blur-xl sm:p-9\" data-kid=\"2-10-1-2\" data-name=\"contact form\">\n                <div class=\"grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2\" data-kid=\"2-10-1-2-1\" data-name=\"form fields grid\">\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-10-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"name field container\">\n                        <label class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-[var(--ink-2)]\" data-kid=\"2-10-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"name label\">\n                            Nombre\n                        </label>\n                        <input class=\"w-full rounded-xl border border-[rgba(254,243,199,.16)] bg-[rgba(12,10,9,.5)] px-4 py-3 text-[15px] text-[var(--cream)] outline-hidden placeholder:text-[var(--ink-3)] focus:border-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"2-10-1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"name input\" placeholder=\"Ej. Lucía Martínez\" type=\"text\"/>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-10-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"email field container\">\n                        <label class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-[var(--ink-2)]\" data-kid=\"2-10-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"email label\">\n                            Email\n                        </label>\n                        <input class=\"w-full rounded-xl border border-[rgba(254,243,199,.16)] bg-[rgba(12,10,9,.5)] px-4 py-3 text-[15px] text-[var(--cream)] outline-hidden placeholder:text-[var(--ink-3)] focus:border-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"2-10-1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"email input\" placeholder=\"tu@email.com\" type=\"email\"/>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-col gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-10-1-2-2\" data-name=\"message field container\">\n                    <label class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-[var(--ink-2)]\" data-kid=\"2-10-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"message label\">\n                        Mensaje\n                    </label>\n                    <textarea class=\"w-full resize-none rounded-xl border border-[rgba(254,243,199,.16)] bg-[rgba(12,10,9,.5)] px-4 py-3 text-[15px] text-[var(--cream)] outline-hidden placeholder:text-[var(--ink-3)] focus:border-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"2-10-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"message textarea\" placeholder=\"¿En qué podemos ayudarte?\" rows=\"5\"></textarea>\n                </div>\n                <button class=\"gold-pill mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--gold)] px-8 py-3.5 text-[14px] font-bold text-[#231404]\" data-kid=\"2-10-1-2-3\" data-name=\"submit button\" type=\"button\">\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-send\" data-kid=\"2-10-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"send icon\">\n                    </i>\n                    Enviar Mensaje\n                </button>\n            </form>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <!-- ============ FOOTER ============ -->\n    <footer class=\"relative border-t border-[var(--line)] bg-[var(--obsidian-2)] pt-16\" data-kid=\"2-11\" data-name=\"footer\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1240px] px-6 lg:px-10\" data-kid=\"2-11-1\" data-name=\"footer container\">\n            <div class=\"grid gap-10 pb-12 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr_1fr_1fr]\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1\" data-name=\"footer links grid\">\n                <div data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-1\" data-name=\"footer brand block\">\n                    <a class=\"pf text-[26px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"footer brand link\" href=\"#\">\n                        Cine\n                        <span class=\"text-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"footer brand highlight\">\n                            Classify\n                        </span>\n                    </a>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 max-w-[280px] text-[14px] text-[var(--ink-3)]\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"footer brand description\">\n                        El archivo personal de cine y series para quienes tienen algo que decir sobre cada título.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"mt-6 flex gap-3\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-1-3\" data-name=\"social media links\">\n                        <a aria-label=\"GitHub\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[var(--line)] text-[var(--ink-2)] hover:border-[var(--gold)] hover:text-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"social link 1\" href=\"#\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-brand-github\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"social icon 1\">\n                            </i>\n                        </a>\n                        <a aria-label=\"X\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[var(--line)] text-[var(--ink-2)] hover:border-[var(--gold)] hover:text-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"social link 2\" href=\"#\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-brand-x\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"social icon 2\">\n                            </i>\n                        </a>\n                        <a aria-label=\"LinkedIn\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[var(--line)] text-[var(--ink-2)] hover:border-[var(--gold)] hover:text-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-1-3-3\" data-name=\"social link 3\" href=\"#\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-brand-linkedin\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-1-3-3-1\" data-name=\"social icon 3\">\n                            </i>\n                        </a>\n                        <a aria-label=\"Instagram\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[var(--line)] text-[var(--ink-2)] hover:border-[var(--gold)] hover:text-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-1-3-4\" data-name=\"social link 4\" href=\"#\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-brand-instagram\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-1-3-4-1\" data-name=\"social icon 4\">\n                            </i>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-2\" data-name=\"column explore\">\n                    <h4 class=\"pf text-[15px] font-semibold text-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"explore title\">\n                        Explorar\n                    </h4>\n                    <ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-[14px] text-[var(--ink-2)]\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"explore links\">\n                        <li data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"link 1\">\n                            <a class=\"hover:text-[var(--cream)]\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"link 1 anchor\" href=\"#catalogo\">\n                                Catálogo\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                        <li data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"link 2\">\n                            <a class=\"hover:text-[var(--cream)]\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"link 2 anchor\" href=\"#ranking\">\n                                Mejores calificadas\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                        <li data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"link 3\">\n                            <a class=\"hover:text-[var(--cream)]\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"link 3 anchor\" href=\"#\">\n                                Series\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                        <li data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-2-2-4\" data-name=\"link 4\">\n                            <a class=\"hover:text-[var(--cream)]\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"link 4 anchor\" href=\"#\">\n                                Estadísticas\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-3\" data-name=\"column community\">\n                    <h4 class=\"pf text-[15px] font-semibold text-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"community title\">\n                        Comunidad\n                    </h4>\n                    <ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-[14px] text-[var(--ink-2)]\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"community links\">\n                        <li data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"link 1\">\n                            <a class=\"hover:text-[var(--cream)]\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"link 1 anchor\" href=\"#\">\n                                Tier Lists públicas\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                        <li data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"link 2\">\n                            <a class=\"hover:text-[var(--cream)]\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"link 2 anchor\" href=\"#\">\n                                Reseñas destacadas\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                        <li data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-3-2-3\" data-name=\"link 3\">\n                            <a class=\"hover:text-[var(--cream)]\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"link 3 anchor\" href=\"#\">\n                                Críticos del mes\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                        <li data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-3-2-4\" data-name=\"link 4\">\n                            <a class=\"hover:text-[var(--cream)]\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-3-2-4-1\" data-name=\"link 4 anchor\" href=\"#\">\n                                Normas de convivencia\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-4\" data-name=\"column press\">\n                    <h4 class=\"pf text-[15px] font-semibold text-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-4-1\" data-name=\"press title\">\n                        Sala de prensa\n                    </h4>\n                    <ul class=\"mt-4 space-y-2.5 text-[14px] text-[var(--ink-2)]\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-4-2\" data-name=\"press links\">\n                        <li data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"link 1\">\n                            <a class=\"hover:text-[var(--cream)]\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"link 1 anchor\" href=\"#contacto\">\n                                Contacto\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                        <li data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-4-2-2\" data-name=\"link 2\">\n                            <a class=\"hover:text-[var(--cream)]\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"link 2 anchor\" href=\"#\">\n                                Privacidad\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                        <li data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-4-2-3\" data-name=\"link 3\">\n                            <a class=\"hover:text-[var(--cream)]\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-4-2-3-1\" data-name=\"link 3 anchor\" href=\"#\">\n                                Términos\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                        <li data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-4-2-4\" data-name=\"link 4\">\n                            <a class=\"hover:text-[var(--cream)]\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-1-4-2-4-1\" data-name=\"link 4 anchor\" href=\"#\">\n                                Prensa\n                            </a>\n                        </li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"h-px w-full bg-[linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--gold),transparent)] opacity-60\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-2\" data-name=\"footer separator line\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-between gap-3 py-7 text-center sm:flex-row sm:text-left\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-3\" data-name=\"footer bottom\">\n                <p class=\"text-[13px] text-[var(--ink-3)]\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-3-1\" data-name=\"copyright notice\">\n                    © 2026 CineClassify Pro · Todos los derechos reservados\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"pf text-[13px] italic text-[var(--ink-2)]\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-3-2\" data-name=\"developer credit text\">\n                    Desarrollado por\n                    <span class=\"text-[var(--gold)]\" data-kid=\"2-11-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"developer name\">\n                        [calomixx]\n                    </span>\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"perf h-3 w-full opacity-50\" data-kid=\"2-11-2\" data-name=\"footer perforation\">\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n</div>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3/dist/gsap.min.js\">\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3/dist/ScrollTrigger.min.js\">\n</script>\n<script>\n    // duplicate film strip set for seamless loop\n  (function(){\n    var track = document.getElementById('strip-track');\n    if(track){\n      var set = track.querySelector('.strip-set');\n      if(set) track.appendChild(set.cloneNode(true));\n    }\n  })();\n\n  window.addEventListener('load', function(){\n    if(!window.gsap) return;\n    gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n    gsap.from('.hero-el', { y: 34, opacity: 0, duration: 1, ease: 'power3.out', stagger: 0.13, delay: 0.15 });\n\n    gsap.utils.toArray('.reveal').forEach(function(el){\n      gsap.from(el, {\n        y: 46, opacity: 0, duration: 0.95, ease: 'power3.out',\n        scrollTrigger: { trigger: el, start: 'top 86%', once: true }\n      });\n    });\n\n    // gentle parallax on the projector beam\n    gsap.to('.projector-beam', {\n      yPercent: 22, scale: 1.08, ease: 'none',\n      scrollTrigger: { trigger: '#inicio', start: 'top top', end: 'bottom top', scrub: true }\n    });\n  });\n</script>\n",
